<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="말씀암송">
    <title>아버님의 말씀 암송 노트</title>
    
    <link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="icon.png">

    <style>
        :root { --base-size: 24px; }
        body { 
            font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', sans-serif; 
            font-size: var(--base-size); 
            text-align: center; 
            padding: 20px; 
            background-color: #f4f6f8; 
            margin: 0;
            user-select: none;
        }
        
        .screen { display: none; }
        .screen.active { display: block; }
        .header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .controls span { font-weight: bold; color: #555; font-size: 0.9em; }
        .btn-control { 
            font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: bold; padding: 8px 15px; 
            background-color: #fff; border: 2px solid #ccc; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; 
        }
        .btn-control:active { background-color: #eee; }
        .btn-back { background-color: #34495e; color: white; border: none; font-size: 0.9em; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: bold; }

        .menu-title { font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.4em; color: #2c3e50; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        
        .mode-tabs { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 25px; }
        .btn-mode {
            flex: 1; padding: 15px 0; font-size: 1.05em; font-weight: bold; 
            border-radius: 12px; border: none; cursor: pointer;
            background-color: #e0e6ed; color: #7f8c8d; transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-mode.active { 
            background-color: #2980b9; color: white; 
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); 
        }

        .verse-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; }
        
        .verse-item {
            background-color: white; border-radius: 15px; padding: 20px;
            font-size: 1.1em; font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); cursor: pointer; border: none;
            transition: transform 0.1s; text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .verse-item:active { transform: scale(0.98); background-color: #f0f0f0; }

        .read-item {
            background-color: white; border-radius: 15px; padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); text-align: left;
        }
        .read-title { font-size: 1.05em; font-weight: bold; color: #e67e22; margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #f9e79f; padding-bottom: 8px;}
        .read-text { font-size: 1.1em; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: bold; word-break: keep-all;}

        .game-title { font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.3em; margin-bottom: 15px; color: #2c3e50; line-height: 1.4; }
        
        .btn-hint {
            font-size: 0.8em; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #9b59b6;
            color: white; border: none; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 3px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .btn-hint:active { transform: scale(0.95); }
        .hint-box {
            display: none; background-color: #fff3cd; color: #856404;
            padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1em; line-height: 1.5; border: 2px dashed #ffeeba; word-break: keep-all;
        }

        .target-area { 
            min-height: 120px; border: 3px dashed #bdc3c7; border-radius: 15px; 
            padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; background-color: white; 
            display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; align-items: center;
        }
        .pool-area { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; }

        button.word-btn, button.target-btn { 
            font-size: 1em; font-weight: bold; padding: 12px 20px; 
            border-radius: 12px; border: none; cursor: pointer; 
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); transition: transform 0.1s;
        }
        button.word-btn:active, button.target-btn:active { transform: scale(0.95); }
        .word-btn { background-color: #27ae60; color: white; }
        .target-btn { background-color: #2980b9; color: white; }

        .message { font-size: 1.3em; color: #e74c3c; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; display: none; line-height: 1.5;}
        .restart-btn { 
            font-size: 0.9em; padding: 12px 25px; background-color: #f39c12; 
            color: white; border: none; border-radius: 10px; margin-top: 15px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div id="menu-screen" class="screen active">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="controls">
                <button class="btn-control" onclick="changeSize(2)">글씨 ＋</button>
                <button class="btn-control" onclick="changeSize(-2)">글씨 －</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="menu-title">📖 아버님의 성경 노트</div>
        
        <div class="mode-tabs">
            <button class="btn-mode active" id="btn-tab-game" onclick="setMode('game')">🧩 암송 게임</button>
            <button class="btn-mode" id="btn-tab-read" onclick="setMode('read')">📖 전체 읽기</button>
        </div>

        <div class="verse-list" id="game-list"></div>
        <div class="verse-list" id="read-list" style="display: none;"></div>
    </div>

    <div id="game-screen" class="screen">
        <div class="header">
            <button class="btn-control btn-back" onclick="showMenu()">◀ 목록으로</button>
            <div class="controls">
                <button class="btn-control" onclick="changeSize(2)">글씨 ＋</button>
                <button class="btn-control" onclick="changeSize(-2)">글씨 －</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="game-title" id="game-title">말씀 제목</div>
        
        <button class="btn-hint" onclick="toggleHint()">👀 힌트 보기</button>
        <div id="hint-box" class="hint-box"></div>

        <div class="target-area" id="target"></div>
        <div class="pool-area" id="pool"></div>

        <div class="message" id="message">
            🎉 아멘! 참 잘하셨습니다! 🎉<br>
            <button class="restart-btn" onclick="initGame()">다시 하기 ↻</button>
        </div>
    </div>

